WEBVTT

00:04.850 --> 00:13.110
<b>A Playthrough of a Certain DUDE's
VRMMO LIFE</b>

01:37.910 --> 01:40.740
Fairy-playah

01:38.970 --> 01:40.750
It should be safe to talk here.

01:41.420 --> 01:43.950
<i>That's clearly some of the
best equipment in the game.</i>

01:43.950 --> 01:47.080
<i>He must be one of the game's top players,
 playing its toughest content!</i>

01:49.440 --> 01:51.570
I won't take up a lot of your time.

01:53.070 --> 01:57.110
Have you ever met a man named Glad?

01:59.570 --> 02:00.680
No.

02:01.890 --> 02:03.610
I see.

02:03.610 --> 02:10.360
I've heard a rumor that he's targeting
players who have the "Fairy-playah" title,

02:10.360 --> 02:13.090
and I thought he might've gone after you.

02:13.090 --> 02:16.520
I'm sorry, but who is this Glad?

02:16.520 --> 02:19.960
A former static member of my party.

02:19.960 --> 02:26.190
We had issues with his behavior,
but he was a very skilled tanker.

02:26.510 --> 02:32.790
"Former" means he's no
longer in your party, right?

02:33.490 --> 02:35.560
You're observant.

02:36.390 --> 02:41.460
Glad became arrogant and began to
look down on the other members.

02:41.910 --> 02:46.050
But when the current event began,

02:46.050 --> 02:48.930
he was the only one to fail to
make a contract with a fairy.

02:50.720 --> 02:52.560
<i>Just like me?</i>

02:53.790 --> 02:58.300
He became extremely upset, and began
to take it out on the other members.

02:58.710 --> 03:03.610
As leader, I had no choice but to banish him.

03:04.630 --> 03:07.210
Though, the bigger problem is...

03:07.210 --> 03:09.280
You can show yourself.

03:12.310 --> 03:14.870
A light Valkyrie?

03:15.580 --> 03:18.570
A perfect humanoid fairy...

03:19.910 --> 03:25.470
Anything I do to try and make him feel
better will just make him angrier.

03:25.470 --> 03:29.660
After the last update, he was able
to get a new contract crystal,

03:29.660 --> 03:32.210
and make a contract with
a darkness fox fairy.

03:32.210 --> 03:35.400
He's going around challenging
people to special PvP duels.

03:35.760 --> 03:37.630
So, even after getting a fairy,

03:37.630 --> 03:41.350
he still feels the humiliation
he felt at the start?

03:41.730 --> 03:47.050
He'll use the tournament on the last day
 of the event as a way to show his strength.

03:47.050 --> 03:50.740
Please be careful and stay away from him.

03:51.580 --> 03:53.660
Thanks for the warning.

03:54.020 --> 03:56.300
I intend to take responsibility for this.

03:56.300 --> 04:00.490
I'll have to scold him at
the tournament, I think.

04:05.010 --> 04:08.370
<i>It's dangerous to just 
believe one side of a story,</i>

04:08.370 --> 04:09.970
<i>but I'll be careful.</i>

04:17.320 --> 04:19.560
<i>It's against the terms of service</i>

04:19.560 --> 04:22.690
<i>to challenge someone to PvP while
they're fighting monsters.</i>

04:23.950 --> 04:27.370
<i>Even if this Glad guy is after me,</i>

04:27.370 --> 04:31.490
<i>as long as I'm hunting out here, I'm safe!</i>

04:44.570 --> 04:46.170
<i>At this distance,
there's time to fire again!</i>

04:46.170 --> 04:48.530
Arts! Mirror Arrow!

04:46.930 --> 04:48.100
<b>Mirror Arrow</b>

05:11.990 --> 05:15.820
The new Bow art I learned is pretty helpful,

05:16.420 --> 05:20.800
but it's still rough fighting
a Wild Bear on my own...

05:21.680 --> 05:25.770
But this is how I'm going to play.

05:25.770 --> 05:27.240
This is what I want.

05:28.640 --> 05:31.760
<b>Skill List
Archery: Lv.41(↑3UP)
Kick: Lv.50(↑3UP)
Long-Distance Vision: Lv.46(↑1UP)
Wind Magic: Lv.46(↑3UP)
Production Fingertips: Lv.43
Cooking: Lv.48(↑2UP)
Concealment: Lv.35(↑3UP)
Improved Physical Abilities: Lv. 50
Theft: Lv.10
Whip: Lv.12

Unequipped Skills
Blacksmith Lv.28(↑3UP)
Woodworking Lv.24
Medicine Lv.35

EXP16
Title: Fairy-playah</b>

05:31.470 --> 05:34.810
<b>Specialize

This will cost 3 EXP.
Are you sure?</b>

05:34.810 --> 05:37.730
Okay, I'll upgrade this to Kick Attack.

05:37.730 --> 05:38.100
<b>Kick Attack</b>

05:37.850 --> 05:40.900
<b>Kick Attack

You've learned Sliding Charge

An art that allows you to hit
the enemy with a sliding tackle,
or rapidly escape from them.</b>

05:42.390 --> 05:44.730
My first kick art!

05:45.390 --> 05:49.740
The update to the skill UI made it
a lot easier to understand, too!

05:55.400 --> 06:00.940
<i>My first job for the day is to hunt
for ore in the mines near Nexia.</i>

06:01.380 --> 06:04.570
<i>My objective is to make
steel and light metal.</i>

06:04.570 --> 06:07.810
<i>There's something I want
to try crafting with them.</i>

06:11.020 --> 06:14.480
Heave! Ho! Heave!

06:18.740 --> 06:22.710
Watch out, everybody!
I hit some explosive ore!

06:35.210 --> 06:37.960
I got it! Sorry, guys!

06:37.960 --> 06:39.450
It's fine!

06:39.450 --> 06:41.610
Thanks for not letting it blow up!

06:41.610 --> 06:45.000
We all would've wound up dead
if that thing had gone off.

06:46.590 --> 06:48.830
The area of effect on that
thing is way too big.

06:48.830 --> 06:50.340
I wish they'd nerf it.

06:50.340 --> 06:53.980
Some people take advantage of that, though.

06:53.980 --> 06:56.830
The bomb masters, you could call 'em.

07:04.230 --> 07:07.480
Blacks, I'm borrowing your smithy again.

07:07.480 --> 07:09.390
Oh, Earth.

07:09.390 --> 07:11.750
You got another weird thing you want to try?

07:11.750 --> 07:15.180
"Weird"? That's rude.

07:16.360 --> 07:18.150
Well, good luck!

07:19.570 --> 07:20.740
Now, then...

07:23.460 --> 07:27.490
<i>Today, I'm making a new
arrowhead and a metal whip.</i>

07:27.870 --> 07:30.810
<i>The arrowhead is twisted so
it can dig into flesh easier.</i>

07:27.880 --> 07:33.300
<b>Twisted-Blade Dagger</b>

07:30.810 --> 07:33.300
<i>I got the idea from an item
called a twisted-blade dagger.</i>

07:37.490 --> 07:41.060
It's hard to get the twist right.

07:41.840 --> 07:44.130
Okay, one more time!

07:49.460 --> 07:51.490
I think I've got it!

07:51.780 --> 07:55.260
I've finally been able to add a
status debuff to an arrow itself!

07:52.950 --> 07:56.530
<b>Twister Arrow
Its arrowhead is improved by twisting it halfway, making it easier to pierce
an opponent. However, this makes it much more expensive to craft. A hit
with this will cause a "Laceration" debuff, which reduces enemy HP over time.</b>

07:55.260 --> 07:56.520
That makes it much stronger!

07:56.820 --> 07:58.890
Now for the whip!

08:29.550 --> 08:31.440
Is that the finished product?

08:31.440 --> 08:35.110
Yes. I made the whole
thing out of light metal!

08:35.530 --> 08:37.000
I see!

08:36.370 --> 08:43.910
<b>Triangle Blade Whip
A brutal whip lined with numerous thin, scale-like blades. 
The blades will constrict and damage the unfortunate victim.
When an opponent is bound, they will continually receive damage.</b>

08:37.000 --> 08:40.300
Light metal is light and supple like bamboo,

08:40.300 --> 08:43.910
so I was thinking that if you stretched
it out, you could make it into a whip.

08:43.910 --> 08:46.310
It must've taken a lot of work, though!

08:46.310 --> 08:49.010
My arms are so stiff I can't lift them!

08:51.090 --> 08:53.860
I'll be heading out for the day.

08:53.860 --> 08:55.960
Okay, bye!

09:00.920 --> 09:07.170
Hello? I'd like to borrow a spot
to work on some explosive ore...

09:07.170 --> 09:11.100
Sure, just use the room downstairs.

09:13.540 --> 09:17.100
<i>I didn't know the
 formulation shop had a basement.</i>

09:17.100 --> 09:21.490
<i>But even if I fail down here,
it won't bother anybody!</i>

09:22.200 --> 09:27.170
<i>The risk it'll blow up on me is too big
for me to be able to use it right now.</i>

09:27.580 --> 09:30.210
<i>But I don't want to just throw
away such a powerful item.</i>

09:31.100 --> 09:36.760
<i>I'll see how far I can get
with my medicine skill...</i>

09:37.800 --> 09:41.410
<i>But in the real world, 
I'm not a technical person at all.</i>

09:41.410 --> 09:44.500
<i>It's exhausting to have to
actually think for once.</i>

09:45.180 --> 09:50.030
<i>I started by mixing in so me oil and
herbs along with a piece of the ore</i>

09:50.380 --> 09:54.140
<i>to adjust the speed at
which it ignites, but...</i>

09:59.360 --> 10:03.570
But if I want to find the best ratios,
 I'll need to experiment!

10:03.950 --> 10:05.320
I'll start with A!

10:10.210 --> 10:12.670
<i>It didn't ignite. That's a failure.</i>

10:13.330 --> 10:14.720
Now, B!

10:24.610 --> 10:27.540
That took 80% of my HP!

10:28.180 --> 10:30.460
It's too powerful.

10:30.460 --> 10:35.020
But maybe I could use it to take a monster
down with me if I were about to die?

10:35.150 --> 10:38.610
<b>Hell Mine Oil
A dangerous oil that has such a wide area of effect
that the person who threw it will get caught in the blast.
Best used in traps.</b>

10:35.560 --> 10:38.610
I'll name it Hell Mine Oil, I guess.

10:42.890 --> 10:44.200
Okay!

10:44.990 --> 10:47.110
Lastly, the C oil!

10:47.110 --> 10:49.190
Please work!

10:53.040 --> 10:54.300
This is it!

10:54.300 --> 10:55.720
That's the ratio I want!

10:55.720 --> 10:58.330
I'll make a bunch of this one!

10:55.840 --> 10:58.760
<b>Enhanced Oil
Creates a pillar of flame when the bottle shatters.
Anyone within the area of effect will take a large
amount of damage and suffer the status effect "Burns".</b>

11:05.470 --> 11:08.760
Veni Gutadia Acrus Ratula!

11:08.760 --> 11:10.190
Wind Cutter!

11:21.100 --> 11:24.390
The oil made this a lot easier!

11:25.260 --> 11:28.960
<i>I can't raise my skills if I rely
on it too much, but still...</i>

11:30.830 --> 11:32.960
<b>Your Hunting Bow skill
has reached Lv50.

You have learned Gatling Arrow.</b>

11:32.710 --> 11:34.750
<b>Your Wind Magic skill has reached Lv50.
You have learned Fly.</b>

11:34.760 --> 11:36.230
Nice!

11:36.750 --> 11:36.840
<b>Your Wind Magic skill has reached Lv50.
You have learned Fly.</b>

11:36.840 --> 11:46.680
<b>You have reached Lv50 in both
Hunting Bow and Wind Magic.
You have unlocked the ability to
combine the two into the specialized
skill Aeolian Dust Hunting Bow.

If you do this, you will learn the
unique Aeolian Dust Hunting Bow art,
but lose the ability to increase your
high-rank Hunting Bow and
Wind Magic skills.</b>

11:39.810 --> 11:42.120
<i>"Aeolian Dust Hunting Bow"...</i>

11:42.120 --> 11:46.690
<i>An elemental weapon art that lets you
add magical properties to a weapon.</i>

11:47.160 --> 11:50.460
<i>I'm interested in more powerful wind magic,</i>

11:50.460 --> 11:53.660
<i>but to me, magic is just a support skill.</i>

11:53.660 --> 11:58.390
<i>I'm just going to believe that wind and
bows are a good combination, and say yes.</i>

11:58.860 --> 12:01.450
<b>This decision is absolutely
irrevocable! Are you sure?</b>

12:01.450 --> 12:03.910
<i>They really want to make sure I'm sure, huh?</i>

12:04.370 --> 12:07.280
<b>This decision is absolutely
irrevocable! Are you sure?</b>

12:05.570 --> 12:08.970
<i>Now then, time to check out my new art...</i>

12:10.500 --> 12:12.400
Gatling Arrow!

12:12.330 --> 12:15.170
<b>Gatling Arrow</b>

12:16.770 --> 12:18.380
<i>I can fire in bursts!</i>

12:21.500 --> 12:24.370
<i>I guess the most I can do is
two at a time at this level.</i>

12:24.880 --> 12:26.350
And my other one is...

12:27.610 --> 12:29.340
Ad Caelum!

12:29.340 --> 12:30.380
Fly!

12:29.970 --> 12:31.890
<b>Fly</b>

12:35.960 --> 12:39.880
<i>Wind support magic?
That looks really helpful!</i>

12:42.340 --> 12:44.660
You got a whole bunch today, huh?

12:44.660 --> 12:47.330
You want me to make a
 leather cape with this, right?

12:47.330 --> 12:51.400
Yeah. I want to reduce how much
damage I take from the rear.

12:51.400 --> 12:52.710
I'm on it.

12:54.570 --> 12:55.740
Fanfare?

12:55.740 --> 13:00.660
<i>An announcement for all players
of One More Free Life Online!</i>

13:00.660 --> 13:06.590
<i>We are now concluding the scoring
for the Fairy PvP event!</i>

13:04.670 --> 13:05.980
Hey, Earth!

13:06.750 --> 13:08.120
Hey!

13:07.440 --> 13:08.770
<i>I repeat.</i>

13:08.120 --> 13:11.620
Nobody from our guild really
spent a lot of time on this.

13:08.770 --> 13:14.460
<i>We are now concluding the scoring
for the Fairy PvP event!</i>

13:11.620 --> 13:13.960
I doubt anybody made it into the tournament.

13:13.960 --> 13:17.290
There are only 16 slots.
I wouldn't worry about it.

13:17.590 --> 13:24.080
<i>And now, we'll announce the players who
earned the right to be in the final tournament!</i>

13:21.360 --> 13:30.330
<b>Silver</b>

13:21.860 --> 13:30.330
<b>Glad</b>

13:23.200 --> 13:27.920
Two of them have a way higher win rate and
number of battles fought than the others.

13:27.920 --> 13:30.330
Yeah. That's incredible.

13:30.820 --> 13:32.740
<i>Silver and Glad.</i>

13:32.740 --> 13:36.680
<i>After hearing what Silver had to say,
I'm worried about their relationship,</i>

13:36.680 --> 13:40.030
<i>but I can't control my desire
to see their battle!</i>

13:46.990 --> 13:54.430
Thank you, everyone, for coming
to our special tournament server!

13:54.430 --> 13:57.090
We hope you enjoy the show!

13:57.100 --> 14:03.030
Fairy-playah

13:57.380 --> 14:03.020
Wow. I bet most of the game's
players are here today.

14:03.020 --> 14:05.650
<i>If there are this many people here...</i>

14:05.650 --> 14:07.330
<i>I'll use my Long-Distance Vision!</i>

14:09.620 --> 14:11.370
Fairy-playah

14:11.620 --> 14:13.370
Fairy-playah

14:13.370 --> 14:15.860
<i>I knew there'd be people
here who knew my pain!</i>

14:16.700 --> 14:20.200
Let the first battle begin!

14:26.140 --> 14:29.490
Their levels are so high that
the fights are awesome!

14:29.490 --> 14:32.820
I think their fairies have
evolved a bunch of times, too.

14:32.820 --> 14:33.940
Yeah.

14:35.000 --> 14:40.220
<i>Even if I entered, I'd be lucky 
to win 10% of my matches.</i>

14:44.190 --> 14:45.870
Match set!

14:50.060 --> 14:54.120
<i>Particles of light went from the
losing fairy to the winning one?</i>

14:54.650 --> 14:57.510
<i>That effect didn't exist during Fairy PvP.</i>

14:58.190 --> 15:00.090
<i>What's going on?</i>

15:11.340 --> 15:14.210
<i>I should've known it'd be
these two in the final match.</i>

15:14.880 --> 15:17.790
We finally meet, Glad.

15:20.240 --> 15:22.160
Give it up, old man.

15:22.160 --> 15:24.080
Or is there still something you want to say?

15:24.370 --> 15:26.410
There's nothing I want to say.

15:26.410 --> 15:28.730
But... I must make you mend your ways.

15:28.730 --> 15:31.210
Make me mend my ways? How so?

15:31.210 --> 15:33.580
By breaking you!

15:33.910 --> 15:36.480
Fine. Come and get me!

15:40.520 --> 15:42.940
Your ax distracts the enemy 
while you knock them off-balance.

15:42.940 --> 15:45.220
I've seen that trick a ton of times!

15:55.390 --> 15:57.250
Wow.

15:57.250 --> 16:00.300
So that's what a top player looks like, huh?

16:00.780 --> 16:03.880
<i>Silver said he'd take responsibility.</i>

16:04.340 --> 16:05.540
<i>But...</i>

16:12.420 --> 16:15.450
Moon Crescent!

16:15.740 --> 16:17.410
<b>Moon Crescent</b>

16:17.610 --> 16:18.700
What?

16:19.000 --> 16:21.050
<i>He dodged with Wind Boost?</i>

16:21.050 --> 16:23.580
<i>He knows Wind Magic?</i>

16:23.580 --> 16:25.640
You fell for it, old man!

16:25.640 --> 16:27.790
You can't dodge me mid-air!

16:27.790 --> 16:29.170
Cross Line!

16:28.500 --> 16:31.170
<b>Cross Line</b>

16:38.680 --> 16:40.520
The match is over!

16:40.520 --> 16:43.430
The winner is Glad!

16:43.940 --> 16:46.340
We're even now, old man.

16:46.340 --> 16:49.330
The two of them looked like they
were about the same strength...

16:49.330 --> 16:51.910
I guess he was more obsessed with victory.

16:52.470 --> 16:53.270
Huh?

17:01.020 --> 17:02.750
You evolved, huh?

17:02.750 --> 17:04.800
I hope you're worth something.

17:07.830 --> 17:09.460
I refuse.

17:09.460 --> 17:12.390
I refuse to allow you in my
presence for another moment.

17:12.390 --> 17:14.620
What? What do you mean?

17:15.090 --> 17:16.880
First, listen to me.

17:17.490 --> 17:23.580
The purpose of this event was to select
the next ruler of the fairies.

17:23.580 --> 17:27.440
We were given a prophecy
that told us our next ruler

17:27.440 --> 17:30.780
should be someone strong and
 well-versed in the arts of war.

17:30.780 --> 17:32.180
So what?

17:32.510 --> 17:35.610
Fairies are not warlike creatures.

17:36.160 --> 17:40.700
Thus, we decided to learn how to fight
from humans, the masters of war.

17:40.700 --> 17:43.410
The winner of a fight would inherit
the experiences of the loser,

17:43.410 --> 17:46.160
until only one was left,
who would become our ruler.

17:46.160 --> 17:47.290
And that was me.

17:47.550 --> 17:50.430
And so as soon as you're done
with us, you're ditching us?

17:50.430 --> 17:52.470
How convenient for you.

17:52.920 --> 17:56.070
I don't think the others will be leaving.

17:56.810 --> 18:00.920
I'm leaving you because our
contract is at an end.

18:00.920 --> 18:02.730
Remember what you always said?

18:02.730 --> 18:06.390
"I'm gonna get even with that old geezer!
I'll have my revenge!"

18:06.390 --> 18:08.210
And you just got it!

18:08.570 --> 18:10.860
So I meant nothing to you.

18:11.140 --> 18:13.400
Did I mean anything to you?

18:13.900 --> 18:16.790
I was never your partner.

18:16.790 --> 18:18.790
I was just a tool.

18:18.790 --> 18:23.660
So I used you as a tool
to help me become queen.

18:23.660 --> 18:26.770
Cut the crap! I'm not your tool!

18:26.770 --> 18:29.090
And I'll say those exact words to you!

18:30.070 --> 18:32.020
I'm not your tool.

18:32.020 --> 18:35.770
To you, this world may be a game.

18:35.770 --> 18:38.170
But it's real to me!

18:38.470 --> 18:43.430
That Fairy Queen is talking
like she's a real person.

18:44.620 --> 18:47.860
<i>Yeah, it doesn't seem like just an AI.</i>

18:47.860 --> 18:50.410
<i>Is she some experiment or research project?</i>

18:50.410 --> 18:53.110
<i>No, it'd be rude to start asking questions
like that. I'll just forget it.</i>

18:53.420 --> 18:55.170
I'll give you a reward.

18:55.170 --> 18:58.440
Three hundred thousand gloh, in addition
to the prize for winning the tournament.

18:58.440 --> 19:01.830
I'll also make sure you get
a contract with a fairy

19:01.830 --> 19:04.310
that was as strong as me before I evolved.

19:04.310 --> 19:06.030
You want somebody obedient, right?

19:06.030 --> 19:07.690
I refuse to accept that!

19:07.690 --> 19:10.240
Oh, are you going to resort to force?

19:10.240 --> 19:14.880
If you can defeat me, I'll accept
your strength and accompany you.

19:14.880 --> 19:18.910
But if you lose, you won't get
the extra money or the fairy.

19:18.910 --> 19:22.240
You can't step up to the table unless
you're willing to bet something.

19:22.240 --> 19:24.900
That's your human rule, right?

19:24.900 --> 19:28.310
Come on, fight me!
I'll make you obey me once more!

19:29.110 --> 19:31.220
Let's begin, then.

19:34.390 --> 19:35.550
Earthquake.

19:35.690 --> 19:36.980
<b>Earthquake</b>

19:36.990 --> 19:38.790
Is that supposed to throw me off-guard?

19:40.240 --> 19:41.840
Fire Lance.

19:41.840 --> 19:44.570
Wind Cutter. Water Lance.

19:44.950 --> 19:46.490
<b>Fire Lance Wind Cutter Water Lance</b>

19:46.860 --> 19:48.800
How is she casting that fast?

19:48.800 --> 19:52.170
And each spell has five bolts!

19:58.440 --> 19:59.220
Fly!

19:58.510 --> 19:59.670
<b>Fly</b>

20:00.030 --> 20:01.860
Is that all you've got?!

20:03.970 --> 20:04.850
Shock.

20:04.760 --> 20:06.680
<b>Shock</b>

20:06.940 --> 20:09.900
Elpitaga Flamma Artido.

20:09.900 --> 20:11.740
High Explosion!

20:13.520 --> 20:14.690
<b>High Explosion</b>

20:20.630 --> 20:21.870
I can still fight...

20:21.870 --> 20:23.940
Sustena Lumina.

20:23.860 --> 20:26.780
<b>Lightning</b>

20:23.940 --> 20:26.770
Lightning.

20:36.630 --> 20:37.500
Fire Lance.

20:37.500 --> 20:38.240
Wind Cutter.

20:38.240 --> 20:39.090
Water Lance.

20:39.090 --> 20:39.830
Lightning.

20:53.470 --> 20:55.750
You have one HP left.

20:55.750 --> 20:57.060
Will you still fight?

21:00.970 --> 21:03.480
That should've served to break his pride.

21:06.300 --> 21:08.480
I'll let you take over.

21:08.480 --> 21:10.070
Thank you.

21:13.690 --> 21:18.830
I should've been the one
to do this for you...

21:20.480 --> 21:24.840
And there are still three who need a reward!

21:33.750 --> 21:36.370
Thank you for refusing to fight,

21:36.370 --> 21:39.610
even though it meant giving up on
a chance to evolve your fairy!

21:40.300 --> 21:43.740
Evolution was supposed to
be a reward for battling,

21:43.740 --> 21:46.320
but I wanted some of us
to not have to battle.

21:46.780 --> 21:49.620
As a thank you,
I'll increase your fairies' ranks.

21:51.040 --> 21:55.190
And as for you...

21:56.060 --> 21:58.780
You're going to fight me!

21:58.780 --> 21:59.650
What?

22:03.260 --> 22:07.260
<b>Episode 4</b>

22:03.260 --> 22:07.260
<b>Earth Receives a Reward
He's Not Sure He's Happy About</b>

22:07.430 --> 22:09.930
<b>To Be Continued</b>
